    "preamble": "Karthikeyan T.K vs K.P. Musthafa Food Safety Officer ... on 9 April, 2024 Author: Bechu Kurian Thomas Bench: Bechu Kurian Thomas Crl.MC No.3764/2023 1/1 In The High Court Of Kerala At Ernakulam Present The Honourable Mr. Justice Bechu Kurian Thomas Tuesday, the 9th day of April 2024 / 20th Chaithra, 1946 Crl.M.Appl.No.1/2023 In Crl.Mc No. 3764 Of 2023 Cc 1928/2020 Of Judicial Magistrate Of First Class -Ii,Hosdrug, Kasargod Petitioners/Petitioners: Karthikeyan T.K. Aged 61 Years S/O Govindan T.K. Muzhakkom, Valiyapoll P.O. Cheruvathur Kasargod Dist (Fbo) M/S Twenty-20 Super Market Dr. No. 32/696 A1, Weavers Street, Nileswar P.O., Kasargod District Pin - 671314 And 3 Others Respondents/Respondent: K.P. Musthafa Food Safety Officer Trikaripur Circle Nr. Village Office Nileswar Pin - 671314 And 2 Others Application praying that in the circumstances stated therein the High Court be pleased to stay all further proceedings in C.C. 1928/2020 pending on the files of the Judicial First Class Magistrate Ii, Hosdurg, pending disposal of the above Criminal Miscellaneous Case. This Application again coming on for orders upon perusing the application along with connected cases and this court's order dated 12/10/2023 in Crl.M.A.1/2023 and upon hearing the arguments of Mr. Premjit Nagendran, Advocate for the petitioner and the Public Prosecutor for R1 and R2 and of Standing Counsel for R3 , the court passed the following: Order",
